	"title": "Monster Manual (2014)",
	"description": "<p><strong>The A to Z Fantasy Bestiary</strong></p>\r\n<p>The Monster Manual adds a horde of classic Dungeons &amp; Dragons creatures, including dragons, giants, mind flayers, and beholders - to fill your campaign and challenge your players.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Adds <strong>150 deadly monsters</strong> to use in the Encounter Builder to create &amp; run organized battles for your party<br />&bull;&nbsp;Unlocks <strong>detailed stat blocks</strong> and references for each D&amp;D monster, animal, and NPC</p>\r\n<p>Complete the core Dungeons &amp; Dragons collection:<br /><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">-&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #3366ff;\"><a style=\"color: #3366ff;\" href=\"https://www.dndbeyond.com/marketplace/sourcebooks/tashas-cauldron-of-everything?icid_source=mmmp&amp;icid_medium=crosspromo&amp;icid_campaign=tcoe\" target=\"_blank\">Tasha's Cauldron of Everything</a><strong><a href=\"https://www.dndbeyond.com/marketplace/sourcebooks/players-handbook?icid_source=dmgmp&amp;icid_medium=crosspromo\" target=\"_blank\"><br /></a></strong></span>-&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #3366ff;\"><a style=\"color: #3366ff;\" href=\"https://www.dndbeyond.com/marketplace/sourcebooks/players-handbook?icid_source=mmmp&amp;icid_medium=crosspromo&amp;icid_campaign=phb\" target=\"_blank\">Player's Handbook</a></span></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">-<span style=\"color: #3366ff;\">&nbsp;<a style=\"color: #3366ff;\" href=\"https://www.dndbeyond.com/marketplace/sourcebooks/xanathars-guide-to-everything?icid_source=mmmp&amp;icid_medium=crosspromo&amp;icid_campaign=xgtw\" target=\"_blank\">Xanathar's Guide To Everything<br /></a></span></span>-&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #3366ff;\"><a style=\"color: #3366ff;\" href=\"https://www.dndbeyond.com/marketplace/sourcebooks/dungeon-masters-guide?icid_source=mmmp&amp;icid_medium=crosspromo&amp;icid_campaign=dmg\" target=\"_blank\">Dungeon Master's Guide</a></span></p>\r\n<hr />\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This purchase unlocks the contents of this source for use with D&amp;D Beyond, including the book in digital format in the game compendium&nbsp;and access options from the book in the searchable listings, character builder, and digital sheet.</span></p>",
